## Access Modifiers (default, public, private, protected)
- Compiler Generated Constructor
```JAVA
public ConstructorName() {
    super();
}
```
|Modifier Name| Same Class | Same Package | Subclass (Other Package) | Other Classes | 
|------|--------|-----|------|-------|
| default | ✔️  |  ✔️ | ❌ | ❌  |
| private | ✔️  |  ️❌ |  ❌ | ❌  |
| public  | ️ ✔️ |  ✔️️ | ✔️  |  ✔️️ |
| protected |✔️ |  ✔️ | ✔️ |  ❌️ |